     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Symptoms",
     "texto": [
      "**Demam** means fever, **pusing** means headache or dizziness, and **mual** means nauseous. **Batuk** and **pilek** mean cough and cold."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "An everyday expression",
     "texto": [
      "**Masuk angin** is used colloquially to talk about feeling unwell or having a cold. It doesn't literally mean \"the wind gets in\", and on its own it isn't a precise medical diagnosis."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
